### Trigger full client sync (raw + stage)
POST http://localhost:3000/ingestion/sync/client

### Trigger client raw sync only
POST http://localhost:3000/ingestion/raw/client

### Trigger client stage sync only
POST http://localhost:3000/ingestion/stage/client

### Trigger full client sync (raw + stage) on Docker collector
POST http://localhost:3010/ingestion/sync/client

### Trigger client raw sync only on Docker collector
POST http://localhost:3010/ingestion/raw/client

### Trigger client stage sync only on Docker collector
POST http://localhost:3010/ingestion/stage/client

### Trigger full organisation sync (raw + stage)
POST http://localhost:3000/ingestion/sync/organisation

### Trigger organisation raw sync only
POST http://localhost:3000/ingestion/raw/organisation

### Trigger organisation stage sync only
POST http://localhost:3000/ingestion/stage/organisation

### Trigger full organisation sync (raw + stage) on Docker collector
POST http://localhost:3010/ingestion/sync/organisation

### Trigger organisation raw sync only on Docker collector
POST http://localhost:3010/ingestion/raw/organisation

### Trigger organisation stage sync only on Docker collector
POST http://localhost:3010/ingestion/stage/organisation

### Trigger personnel stage sync only
POST http://localhost:3000/ingestion/stage/personnel

### Trigger personnel stage sync only on Docker collector
POST http://localhost:3010/ingestion/stage/personnel

### Trigger employer stage sync only
POST http://localhost:3000/ingestion/stage/employer

### Trigger employer stage sync only on Docker collector
POST http://localhost:3010/ingestion/stage/employer

### List configured ingestion entities
GET http://localhost:3000/ingestion/entities

### List configured ingestion entities on Docker collector
GET http://localhost:3010/ingestion/entities
